		{ type = "quest", id = 92421 },
	},
	hint = "Seek the keep in the western hills that bears his name.",
	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Garek Bandarion was a soldier of {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link} who died in its fall and rose among the {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link}. He became the first captain of the Deathguard, and he was the first of the Forsaken to take up the {link:holy-light}Holy Light{/link} as a paladin. He fell when the necropolis {red:naxxramas}Naxxramas{/red} came against the {link:undercity}Undercity{/link}. The paladins of {link:tyr-s-watch}Tyr's Watch{/link} named their monastery after him, and they still speak his name as a battle cry.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[To the {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link} paladins, Garek is proof that the Light did not abandon them in death. To the Deathguard, he is the captain who built their ranks. His life joins the last days of the living kingdom to the first days of the dead one.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• In life, he served in the City Guard of the capital under Captain Landen, who chose him as his successor.
• On the day {link:arthas-menethil}Arthas{/link} murdered his father, he and Landen led survivors out through the sewers beneath the city.
• He took his vengeance on Baron Rivendare, the lord who betrayed the kingdom to the {link:cult-of-the-damned}Cult of the Damned{/link}, and died of his wounds and the plague.
• As a {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link}, he fought beside {link:dark-ranger-anya}Dark Ranger Anya{/link} in the first days of the {link:undercity}Undercity{/link}.
• He rose to be captain of the Deathguard.
• He died in the defense of the Undercity against Naxxramas.]=],
		},
	},
	chapters = {
		{
			key = "the-last-days-of-lordaeron",
			title = "The Last Days of Lordaeron",
			hint = [=[Learn what the Forsaken of the Undercity say of their first captain.]=],
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 92421 },
			},
			text = [=[Garek was a young guardsman who longed for battle, and his captain, Landen, told him that protecting the people was the greater glory. On the night {link:arthas-menethil}Arthas{/link} slew King {link:terenas-menethil}Terenas Menethil{/link}, they found the throne room full of cultists. {link:uther-the-lightbringer}Uther the Lightbringer{/link} sent them to save whom they could. Beneath the city they found that the cult had long been ready. Landen stayed behind to hold back Baron Rivendare so that Garek could lead the people to safety. Garek never forgave the baron. He hunted him to Stratholme and killed him there, and he died of his wounds.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "a-second-life",
			title = "A Second Life",
			hint = "Hear the paladins of Bandarion Keep speak of their founder.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 96896 },
			},
			text = [=[Garek woke in the vaults of the {link:undercity}Undercity{/link} with no memory but his name. The apothecary Putress wished to use his body for parts. {link:dark-ranger-anya}Dark Ranger Anya{/link} stopped him. Garek swore himself to {link:sylvanas-windrunner}Sylvanas{/link}, and with Anya he gathered the free-willed dead from the ruins, cleared the tunnels and helped the city grow. When the {link:scarlet-crusade}Scarlet Crusade{/link} broke through the walls of the Undercity, he led the Deathguard against them. Somewhere in those years, the Light began to answer him again.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-keep-of-his-name",
			title = "The Keep of His Name",
			hint = "Learn why the fortress on Northface Rock bears his name.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 96899 },
			},
			text = [=[When Naxxramas came to the ruins of the capital, the {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link} and the {link:argent-dawn}Argent Dawn{/link} fought it together on the surface. Garek did not come back. {link:danitha-morr}Danitha Morr{/link} and {link:leonid-barthalomew}Leonid Barthalomew{/link} fought in that battle and lost many friends there. When Danitha took the old fortress on {link:bandarion-keep}Northface Rock{/link} for her order, she named it after him.]=],
		},
	},
	mentions = {
		{
			text = "A Righteous Cause",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 96896 },
			},
		},
		{
			text = "{link:bandarion-keep}Bandarion Keep{/link}",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 96899 },
			},
		},
		{
			text = "Light's Justice",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 92421 },
			},
		},
	},
	bonds = {
		{ id = "dark-ranger-anya", name = "Dark Ranger Anya", note = "his companion" },
		{ id = "danitha-morr", name = "Danitha Morr", note = "named the keep after him" },
		{ id = "leonid-barthalomew", name = "Leonid Barthalomew", note = "a friend" },
		{ id = "sylvanas-windrunner", name = "Sylvanas Windrunner", note = "his queen" },
